You are developing a Bank Account Management System in Python.

A bank has different types of accounts:

Savings Account
Current Account

Every account has:

account_number
holder_name
balance
Requirements
Create a parent class called BankAccount.
Create SavingsAccount and CurrentAccount as child classes.
The BankAccount class should have methods:
deposit(amount)
withdraw(amount)
display_balance()
A Savings Account should allow withdrawal only if sufficient balance is available.
A Current Account should allow withdrawal even when the balance is insufficient, up to a certain overdraft limit.
The withdrawal behavior should be different for Savings and Current accounts.
Account details should not be directly accessible from outside the class. Provide appropriate methods to access/update them.
🎯 Your task

Design the Python program using OOP concepts.

Try to identify which OOP concepts are required before writing the code.

Think about:

Class & Object
Inheritance
Encapsulation
Method Overriding / Polymorphism
Constructor
